This product includes software developed at GeoSphere Austria and the Austrian
Institute of Technology as part of the Digital Twin Austria project HectoRenew
(FO999918390) and the Austrian Climate Research Programme project EnergyProtect
(FO999901419).

Gust estimation follows Wieringa (1973), adapted for energy applications by
Schicker and Meirold-Mautner (2022). Degree-day definitions follow VDI 3787.
Compound event classification follows the typology of Zscheischler et al. (2020).

Access to the Destination Earth Digital Twins follows the example workflows
published by ECMWF; those upstream notebooks are not redistributed here.
